nforming goods remain unchanged.</p><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/shipping-returns#custom-orders' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Custom-order return terms<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></aside><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/contact' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Ask about a local version<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></section></div>
